@startuml
title miniGit 对象写入时序

actor User
participant "object_write" as Write
participant "GitObject.serialize" as Serialize
participant "SHA-1" as Hash
database "objects/" as Store
participant "zlib" as Zlib

User -> Write: 写入对象
Write -> Serialize: serialize()
Serialize --> Write: payload
Write -> Write: 追加 type + size + NUL
Write -> Hash: 计算 SHA-1(raw)
Hash --> Write: object id
Write -> Zlib: 压缩 raw
Zlib --> Write: compressed bytes
Write -> Store: objects/sha[0:2]/sha[2:]
Store --> Write: 已存在则保持不变
Write --> User: 返回 SHA-1
@enduml
